<p class="notice-text">Your feedback is anonymous. We receive your message and the page you were viewing, and which video it is about if you opened this form from a video's Feedback button. Please don't include your name, contact details or anything that could identify you. This box is not monitored for urgent issues. If you need help now, contact your treating team, call Lifeline on 13 11 14, or call 000 in an emergency.</p>
<p class="notice-text">A Cloudflare check on this form stops automated spam. Cloudflare uses technical details such as your IP address and browser for this check, and to improve its spam protection. We don't store them.</p>
